<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on May 27.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on May 27.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				  May 27		 May 23</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.926		  5.169</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  24.619		 22.775</p>
<p>Cash balance		  29.544		 27.943</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,262.087	     5,259.828</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $9 million were issued and $189 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
